Day 1
Design + scaffold script writing agent
Plan architecture
conversational flow for scene outline generation
file ingestion for analysis tools. 

Find a free screenplay online (SimplyScripts or IMSDB)
    look up scripts of movies in the imdb top 250 movies list
Build scene-based chunker splitting on INT. and EXT. headers. 
Confirm chunking works before building anything on top.

Day 2
Build: generate_scene_outline + analyze_structure
Build conversational generate_scene_outline tool first — 
takes logline/premise from conversation, 
returns structured act breakdown with scene beats. 

Then add analyze_structure — 
retrieves key structural moments from ingested script 
and evaluates against three-act framework.